# G10 D4: an exclusion list, not an inclusion list — the only two real savings are src/** (the
# TypeScript source, fully superseded by dist/extension.cjs) and tsconfig.json. node_modules/**
# and **/*.map are belt-and-braces (vsce's own --no-dependencies already drops the former, and no
# sourcemap is emitted today).
#
# DELIBERATELY ABSENT: any pattern touching dist/, .vite/, or a leading dot. html.ts reads
# dist/ui/.vite/manifest.json at RUNTIME to resolve the webview's hashed asset names (F4) — a
# broader ignore here (e.g. "**/.*" or "**/.vite/**") would package cleanly and then throw the
# first time any webview view is opened, with no packaging-time signal at all. Do not add one.
src/**
tsconfig.json
.vscodeignore
node_modules/**
**/*.map
